session Second_Order_Viscosity_Analysis = "HOL-Analysis" +
  description "
    The complete second-order machinery for comparison proofs between
    viscosity solutions -- Rademacher's theorem, Alexandrov's theorem,
    Jensen's lemma for semiconvex functions, the Crandall-Ishii theorem on
    sums, and the doubling-of-variables toolbox they exist to serve --
    without which no comparison principle can be formalised at all.
  "
  sessions
    Symmetric_Matrix_Spectra
  theories
    Convex_Subgradients
    Rademacher
    Moreau_Envelope
    Alexandrov
    Jensen_Lemma
    Sup_Convolution
    Theorem_On_Sums
    Doubling
    Soft_Penalty
  document_files
    "root.tex"
    "root.bib"
